# Landing Content

- `config/site.ts`: brand, nav, contact, WhatsApp, social, footer.
- `config/services.ts`: typed catalog (boda, quinceañera, corporativo, social) with slug, title, description, image.
- `config/gallery.ts`: portfolios grouped by event category.
- `config/testimonials.ts`: client quotes with event type, date, optional photo.
- All commercial copy lives in config; components only render.
- Use `as const` and exported types for nav items and service entries.
